  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jaguar Friendly Pledge</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The natural beauty that attracts tourists to southern Mexico is due in large part to the presence of jaguars, which in their role as keystone and umbrella species keep these ecosystems balanced. Unfortunately, jaguars are seriously threatened.  Animal Karma and Panthera have created the Jaguar Friendly Pledge, a certification that endorses tourist activities in order to encourage responsible and conscious tourism that promotes the conservation of  jaguars and their habitat in Mexico.</narrative>
  </description>
